I am still in the fitting room.
There is a white shirt near me.
It is a cotton shirt.
I take the white shirt in my hand.
First, I look at the price of the shirt.
The price is not high.
Now, I put on the white shirt.
I look in the mirror.
The shirt is not small.
The shirt is also not big.
Its size is perfect.
This is an excellent shirt.
I work in a software office.
For the office, this shirt is perfect.
I am happy.
I am buying this white shirt.
